    "description": "Alteryx Designer empowers data analysts by combining data preparation, data blending, and analytics – predictive, statistical, and spatial — using the same intuitive user interface. Alteryx Designer is a Windows software application that provides an intuitive drag-and- drop user interface for users to create repeatable workflow processes. Users can drag tools from a toolbox onto a canvas, connect them together, and edit their properties to create Alteryx workflows, apps, and macros.\n\nThe Spatial category includes tools that offer spatial data manipulation, processing, and object editing. With an intuitive workflow that allows you to visually bring in several data sets, geocode them, combine them spatially with sources like TomTom and the U.S. Census, and even enrich them with demographic data, Alteryx makes turning traditional data into geospatial data easy — no data scientists required.",
